# A deliberately mutated copy of synthetic-profiles.log: one byte of the
# STORE DATA request's data field changed from 'BF2D00' to 'BF2E00' (a
# bogus tag no ES10 command uses). rsp_card_read_profiles always sends
# the real 'BF 2D 00' -- ProfileInfoListRequest, tag 'BF2D', empty body --
# so replaying this file must refuse that exchange by name rather than
# hand back an answer for a request nobody actually sent. Exists only to
# prove replay's own strictness against this round's specific request
# byte, per tests/test_profiles.c's test_wrong_request_is_refused.
